WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.960
Textbooks sort nociceptors into tidy bins.

2
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.460
What are those bins actually measuring?

3
00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:14.413
Three unrelated kinds of measurement are being mixed: a molecular label, a

4
00:00:14.413 --> 00:00:16.433
conduction class, and a functional state.

5
00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:22.787
A molecular label is a gene whose expression marks a population and gives genetic

6
00:00:22.787 --> 00:00:23.787
access to it.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.480
These are markers, not functions.

8
00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.100
CGRP is not a heat channel.

9
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.760
A conduction class is a velocity measured from an axon.

10
00:00:34.683 --> 00:00:39.823
Mouse high-threshold mechanonociceptors with circumferential hair-follicle endings

11
00:00:39.823 --> 00:00:41.623
carried a peptidergic label.

12
00:00:42.683 --> 00:00:48.643
Their label encodes alpha-CGRP, so a mechanonociceptor sits in a peptidergic class.

13
00:00:49.623 --> 00:00:50.623
The axes cross.

14
00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:54.603
A functional state is something a neuron can change.

15
00:00:55.423 --> 00:00:58.203
Some labelled nociceptors were mechanically silent.

16
00:00:59.233 --> 00:01:03.813
After a day with nerve growth factor, mechanically activated currents appeared.

17
00:01:04.817 --> 00:01:10.097
Knockdown of PIEZO2 prevented them from appearing, so it was required for the

18
00:01:10.097 --> 00:01:11.097
change.

19
00:01:11.467 --> 00:01:14.207
a dish, and in the soma rather than the ending.

20
00:01:15.047 --> 00:01:17.307
Neither result came from an intact ending.

21
00:01:18.267 --> 00:01:23.167
Now remove a whole labelled population in an adult animal and test behaviour.

22
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:29.120
Histology showed that the treatment eliminated more than ninety-eight percent of the

23
00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:30.120
labelled cell bodies.

24
00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:36.440
Mechanical withdrawal threshold rose, while heat and cold responses were spared in

25
00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:37.440
the ranges tested.

26
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:42.930
A lesion of TRPV1-positive central branches did the opposite.

27
00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:48.130
Noxious heat responses went, and baseline mechanical thresholds were unchanged.

28
00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:54.440
Read together, that is a functional dissociation in mice, in those stimulus ranges.

29
00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.560
It is not evidence that every fibre is unimodal, nor that mouse withdrawal reports

30
00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:01.560
human pain.

31
00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:04.670
Adult removal moved one modality.

32
00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:08.810
Predict what happens when the same neurons are deleted from birth.

33
00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:16.033
Nothing detectable.

34
00:02:17.013 --> 00:02:21.153
The mice deleted from birth lacked a mechanical deficit in the later assays.

35
00:02:22.233 --> 00:02:27.893
So a germline deletion is a developmental experiment, and an adult manipulation asks

36
00:02:27.893 --> 00:02:28.893
a different question.

37
00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:34.813
These mouse and cellular experiments measure channels, neurons and reflexes.

38
00:02:35.353 --> 00:02:38.713
The lesson's surgical trials measure what patients reported.

39
00:02:39.613 --> 00:02:41.373
Keep those levels of evidence distinct.
